B.bsh=new A.aY("Primary Colour",B.agU,"Your kennel's primary brand colour as a CSS hex value (e.g. #FF5733 or #FF5733FF for 8-digit RGBA).\n\nThis colour is injected as --color-primary and used for buttons, highlights, and other accent elements.")
